        "original_id": "b3aa2c1b-1f86-5239-bfaa-60dc9f3c876e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rocky Roe\n- Events: 1990 World Series, 1999 World Series, 1984 All-Star Game, 1994 All-Star Game\n- Organizations: Major League Baseball, New York Yankees, Atlanta Braves\n\nFacts:\n- Rocky Roe officiated in the 1984 All-Star Game.\n- Rocky Roe officiated in the 1990 World Series.\n- Rocky Roe officiated in the 1994 All-Star Game.\n- The 1999 World Series was the 95th edition of Major League Baseball's championship series.\n- The 1999 World Series featured the defending American League and World Series champions New York Yankees of the American League against the Atlanta Braves of the National League.\n- Rocky Roe officiated in the 1999 World Series.",
